      "skos:prefLabel": "BPMN activities, extracted (folio-assistant-sci)",
      "skos:definition": "Candidate terms extracted from every BPMN task and call activity: `name` as the label, its own `<documentation>` as the definition, the element id as the code. Generated by folio-assistant-core/scripts/glossary-extract.ts; not curated, and never hand-edited: a person promotes a term by authoring it in a glossary of their own.",
      "dcterms:source": "BPMN activities of folio-assistant-sci"
